    "# NeuroLab: API Integration and Usage Guide\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates how to interact with the NeuroLab API for real-world applications.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Features:**\n",
    "- API endpoint testing and usage\n",
    "- Authentication and security\n",
    "- File upload and processing\n",
    "- Real-time analysis\n",
    "- Voice processing integration\n",
    "- Multimodal analysis workflows\n",
    "\n",
    "**Author:** NeuroLab Team  \n",
